Input: {"question": "Who is the author of \"Why I Am Not\"?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0304-a312981cac28:d00", "start": 0, "end": 106, "text": "Why I Am Not a Christian Why I Am Not a Christian is an essay by the British philosopher Bertrand Russell."}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0304-a312981cac28:d00", "start": 107, "end": 357, "text": "Originally a talk given 6 March 1927 at Battersea Town Hall, under the auspices of the South London Branch of the National Secular Society, it was published that year as a pamphlet and has been republished several times in English and in translation."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0304-a312981cac28:d00", "start": 358, "end": 543, "text": "Russell begins by defining what he means by the term Christian and sets out to explain why he does not \"believe in God and in immortality\" and why he does not \"think that Christ was the"}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0304-a312981cac28:d01", "start": 0, "end": 31, "text": "Notice of Financial Incentive ."}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0304-a312981cac28:d01", "start": 32, "end": 87, "text": "Free ebook offer available to NEW US subscribers only ."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0304-a312981cac28:d01", "start": 88, "end": 155, "text": "Offer redeemable at Simon & Schuster 's ebook fulfillment partner ."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0304-a312981cac28:d01", "start": 156, "end": 184, "text": "Must redeem within 90 days ."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0304-a312981cac28:d01", "start": 185, "end": 242, "text": "See full terms and conditions and this month 's choices ."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0304-a312981cac28:d01", "start": 243, "end": 426, "text": "More books from this author : Bertrand Russell You may also like : Thriller and Mystery Staff Picks More to Explore Limited Time eBook Deals Check out this month 's discounted reads ."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0304-a312981cac28:d01", "start": 427, "end": 542, "text": "Learn More Our Summer Reading Recommendations Red-hot romances , poolside fiction , and blockbuster picks , oh my !"}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0304-a312981cac28:d01", "start": 543, "end": 574, "text": "Start reading the hottest books"}, "D3S1": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0304-a312981cac28:d02", "start": 0, "end": 113, "text": "Why I Am Not a Muslim Why I Am Not a Muslim, a book written by Ibn Warraq, is a critique of Islam and the Qur'an."}, "D3S2": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0304-a312981cac28:d02", "start": 114, "end": 186, "text": "It was first published by Prometheus Books in the United States in 1995."}, "D3S3": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0304-a312981cac28:d02", "start": 187, "end": 342, "text": "The title of the book is a homage to Bertrand Russell's essay, \"Why I Am Not a Christian\", in which Russell criticizes the religion in which he was raised."}, "D3S4": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0304-a312981cac28:d02", "start": 343, "end": 559, "text": "Outraged over the fatwa and death threats against Salman Rushdie, Ibn Warraq assumes a pseudonym to pen what one critic calls \"serious and thought-provoking book\" using a \"sledge-hammer\" approach to \"demolish\" Islam."}, "D4S1": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0304-a312981cac28:d03", "start": 0, "end": 61, "text": ", believer or atheist , would n't take Ibn Warraq seriously ."}, "D4S2": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0304-a312981cac28:d03", "start": 62, "end": 280, "text": "chickenshit e-reads religion-and-theology 36 likes 14 comments Like Comment عماد العتيلي Author 12 books 631 followers Follow Follow September 27 , 2015 بدأت بقراءة هذا الكتاب على التوازي مع كتاب الفيلسوف الكبير راسل ."}, "D4S3": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0304-a312981cac28:d03", "start": 281, "end": 345, "text": "طبعا لا يخفى على أحد أن عنوان وفكرة هذا الكتاب مستوحاة من راسل ."}, "D4S4": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0304-a312981cac28:d03", "start": 346, "end": 379, "text": "اقتحمت الكتاب وفي نيتي أن أقتنع !"}, "D4S5": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0304-a312981cac28:d03", "start": 380, "end": 399, "text": "وأنا أعني ما أقول ."}, "D4S6": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0304-a312981cac28:d03", "start": 400, "end": 536, "text": "ولكنني وجدت أن الحجج الموجودة في الكتاب في غالبيتها الساحقة مبنية على ممارسات المسلمين وفقهائهم الخاطئة، لا على الإسلام القرآني الجامع ."}, "D4S7": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0304-a312981cac28:d03", "start": 537, "end": 558, "text": "وعلى نظريات `` أظن .."}, "D4S8": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0304-a312981cac28:d03", "start": 559, "end": 563, "text": "يبدو"}, "D5S1": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0304-a312981cac28:d04", "start": 0, "end": 18, "text": "became an atheist."}, "D5S2": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0304-a312981cac28:d04", "start": 19, "end": 73, "text": "He also questioned theists about the existence of God."}, "D5S3": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0304-a312981cac28:d04", "start": 74, "end": 202, "text": "Why I Am an Atheist Why I am an Atheist is an essay written by Indian revolutionary Bhagat Singh in 1930 in Lahore Central Jail."}, "D5S4": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0304-a312981cac28:d04", "start": 203, "end": 315, "text": "The essay was a reply to his religious friends who thought Bhagat Singh became an atheist because of his vanity."}, "D5S5": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0304-a312981cac28:d04", "start": 316, "end": 442, "text": "Bhagat Singh was a member of Hindustan Socialist Republican Association, a revolutionary party in the Indian freedom struggle."}, "D5S6": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0304-a312981cac28:d04", "start": 443, "end": 557, "text": "He was an atheist who believed in communism, and he wrote several articles on anarchism and communism for \"Kirti\"."}, "D5S7": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0304-a312981cac28:d04", "start": 558, "end": 584, "text": "He was arrested on 8 April"}, "D6S1": {"document_number": 6, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0304-a312981cac28:d05", "start": 0, "end": 84, "text": "extraordinary philosophical ideas while he was in Lahore Jail waiting to be hanged ?"}, "D6S2": {"document_number": 6, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0304-a312981cac28:d05", "start": 85, "end": 197, "text": "The situation in which he wrote this book might have turned even the strongest atheist into a religious person ."}, "D6S3": {"document_number": 6, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0304-a312981cac28:d05", "start": 198, "end": 220, "text": "But not Bhagat Singh ."}, "D6S4": {"document_number": 6, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0304-a312981cac28:d05", "start": 221, "end": 377, "text": "He is a true example of the word firebrand , which might be the reason why we are still talking about him with so much passion even after around 100 years ."}, "D6S5": {"document_number": 6, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0304-a312981cac28:d05", "start": 378, "end": 459, "text": "Many of us might have heard or studied about Bhagat Singh , the freedom fighter ."}, "D6S6": {"document_number": 6, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0304-a312981cac28:d05", "start": 460, "end": 521, "text": "But there was so much more we had to learn about Bhagat Singh"}, "D7S1": {"document_number": 7, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0304-a312981cac28:d06", "start": 0, "end": 76, "text": "@ 8��k ' J�A� 鋨G.��rp ; �\u0006�\u0001�dFF\u0000�\u0002\b������ 6�a\u000es�����c���2��� ` �'� [ o�1� ?"}, "D7S2": {"document_number": 7, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0304-a312981cac28:d06", "start": 77, "end": 269, "text": "\u001a��\u0019Rm\u0016ţ ` �� �9�h��������H�\u0000na�\u0015=���� > U�K\u0014y-�zd�\u0019j�H\u0000�p\u0007� : ��4� & �E �\b ` z\u0011 @ y�\\� > ] ��/� # �\u0015���\u00185�x���-\u0012��\u0010 �� @ { �A��N�\u0000� { J \u00